From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lapis Bringup <lapis@localhost>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:10:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] lapis: keep stock vendor camera property prefix ownership

The stock vendor already declares this prefix. Duplicating it in system_ext
causes PropertyInit to abort before services start. Gate only this entry;
other products retain the existing context.

---
diff --git a/common/private/property_contexts b/common/private/property_contexts
index 9bdd72f..a3661ba 100644
--- a/common/private/property_contexts
+++ b/common/private/property_contexts
@@ -4,7 +4,8 @@ ro.odm.cast.ssid_suffix u:object_r:odm_cast_prop:s0
 
 # Aux camera
 vendor.camera.aux.packageexcludelist   u:object_r:vendor_persist_camera_prop:s0
-vendor.camera.aux.packagelist          u:object_r:vendor_persist_camera_prop:s0
+# Stock lapis vendor already owns this prefix; duplicate entries abort init.
+ifelse(lapis_stock_camera_property, `true', `', `vendor.camera.aux.packagelist          u:object_r:vendor_persist_camera_prop:s0')
 
 # Bluetooth
 bluetooth.hci.disabled_commands        u:object_r:bluetooth_config_prop:s0
